      },
      "lineNbr": 47,
      "author": {
        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T03:15:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t mind splitting them into separate arrays, but this could be made a little safer (and clearer) by giving each of the type enums a name (`enum pwr_sig_gpio`, etc) and receiving one of those as a parameter rather than a generic integer.",
      "parentUuid": "a25fb710_bc670b99",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 47,
